tion\": \"According to the IPCC, what is likely to happen to global crop yields by 2050?\",\n      \"options\": [\"They will increase by 5%\", \"They will decrease by 1%\", \"They will remain the same\", \"They will decrease by 2%\"],\n      \"answer\": \"d\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What is happening to the nutritional content of wheat and rice due to climate change?\",\n      \"options\": [\"It is increasing\", \"It is remaining the same\", \"It is becoming less nutritious\", \"It is unknown\"],\n      \"answer\": \"c\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What does the IPCC recommend that governments and farmers do to adapt to climate change?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Implementing more efficient irrigation systems\", \"Promoting sustainable agriculture methods\", \"Changing crop varieties\", \"All of the above\"],\n      \"answer\": \"d\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"The author's attitude towards climate change is:\",\n      \"options\": [\"Calm and detached\", \"Concerned but optimistic\", \"Alarmed and urgent\", \"Indifferent and uninterested\"],\n      \"answer\": \"c\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
